# Feature: account
# Use-case: uc.account.change-password
# Use-case doc: ../../../../docs/wiki/features/account/use-cases/uc.account.change-password.md

### Change password and replace PASSWORD master-key wrap
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{sessionToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "{{currentPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}",
  "masterKeyWrap": {
    "unlockMethod": "PASSWORD",
    "suiteId": "v1",
    "wrappedKey": "{{passwordMasterKeyWrap}}",
    "kdfParams": "{{passwordKdfParams}}"
  }
}
